   research hotspots in the field of image processing. With the rise of
   deep learning, more and more scholars have begun to study the
   application of deep learning in the field of hyperspectral object
   detection. However, it costs a lot of time for the models based on deep
   learning to train networks and adjust parameters. This paper mainly
   studies the correlation between different data sets. It hopes to find
   the mapping relationship between different data sets by using transfer
